
# %% [markdown]
# # SAVRec V7 — Final Reproducible Experiment
# 
# This is the cleaned public experiment notebook for the journal submission.
# It contains only the final benchmark construction used by V7, final model
# definitions, final reference-faithful baselines, frozen ablations, robustness
# evaluation, significance analysis, and exploratory mechanism analysis.
